##grflangid 0x01

# General GRF strings
STR_GRF_NAME:California Skyscrapers as Objects
STR_GRF_DESCRIPTION:{}{ORANGE}A variety of California skyscrapers from Los Angeles, San Diego and San Francisco, that can be used as decorative objects. Each building comes with real-world stats and occasional trivia.{}See {DKGREEN}Set parameters {ORANGE}for more detailed settings.{}{}{SILVER}Remake of "Generic Skyscraper Objects Set" by {YELLOW}CaptainKlutz{}{SILVER}Original "California City Set" by {YELLOW}Luxtram{}{SILVER}Updated and recoded by {YELLOW}chujo{}{SILVER}Some decor elements borrowed from {YELLOW}Mrsunman's AEC{}{SILVER}and {YELLOW}Zephyris' Full English.{}{}{SILVER}License: {YELLOW}GPL v2{}{}{}{LTBLUE}August 18, 2026{}{}{}{CREAM}Note:{}A version that works as a drop-in replacement for Generic Skyscraper Objects Set is available: click on {DKGREEN}Visit website {CREAM}or go to github.com/chujo-chujo/California-Skyscrapers-as-Objects.
STR_GRF_URL:https://github.com/chujo-chujo/California-Skyscrapers-as-Objects


# Parameters
STR_PAR_DATES_NAME:Ignore introduction dates
STR_PAR_DATES_DESC:{GOLD}The buildings in this set have predefined introduction dates.{}Enable this parameter to ignore the dates.

STR_PAR_REMOVE_NAME:Remove only by demolishing
STR_PAR_REMOVE_DESC:{GOLD}If enabled, only the demolish tool can be used to remove an object.

STR_PAR_GROUND_NAME:Ground type
STR_PAR_GROUND_DESC:{GOLD}Select the style of ground tiles.
STR_PAR_GROUND_TYPE1:Concrete
STR_PAR_GROUND_TYPE2:Darker concrete
STR_PAR_GROUND_TYPE3:Darkest concrete
STR_PAR_GROUND_TYPE4:Concrete slabs
STR_PAR_GROUND_TYPE5:Darker concrete slabs
STR_PAR_GROUND_TYPE6:Cobblestone

STR_PAR_DECOR_NAME:Disable ground decoration
STR_PAR_DECOR_DESC:{GOLD}Toggle extra objects placed around buildings, such as trees, benches, vehicles, pedestrians, etc.

STR_PAR_SNOW_NAME:Hide snow on ground
STR_PAR_SNOW_DESC:{GOLD}Controls whether snow appears on concrete around buildings.

STR_PAR_MENU_RECOLOR_NAME:Disable recolor preview in menu
STR_PAR_MENU_RECOLOR_DESC:{GOLD}Some buildings have recolorable elements, whose variants are previewed in the purchase menu at regular intervals.{}Use this parameter to turn off the automatic recoloring.


# Class names
STR_GSLA:Skyscrapers:Los Angeles
STR_GSSD:Skyscrapers:San Diego
STR_GSSF:Skyscrapers:San Francisco
STR_GSFB:Skyscrapers:San Francisco Blocks

